---
// packages/web/src/components/About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 bg-surface-1">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16">
      <p class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-snow-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">What is Snowside</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
        An EVM sidechain for eCash,<br />powered by Avalanche
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Snowside is a dedicated Avalanche Layer-1 blockchain built for the eCash hard-fork.
        Native ECX gas, Drivechain security, and instant USDC bridging — no new tokens, no pre-mine.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Native ECX Gas -->
      <div class="bg-surface-2 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-white/5 hover:border-snow-400/30 transition group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-snow-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-snow-500/20 transition">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6bb8e0" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 2v20M2 12h20M5 5l14 14M19 5L5 19" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Native ECX Gas</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          The native gas token is ECX itself — no competing consensus token, no pre-mine. The
          eCash economic model carries over directly to a high-throughput EVM.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Drivechain Security -->
      <div class="bg-surface-2 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-white/5 hover:border-snow-400/30 transition group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-aval-600/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-aval-600/30 transition">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c8e6f7" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5-3.5 9-8 10-4.5-1-8-5-8-10V6l8-4z" />
            <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Drivechain Security</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Blind Merged Mining brings eCash's proof-of-work security to an EVM execution layer —
          without miners running sidechain software or understanding its internals.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- USDC Day One -->
      <div class="bg-surface-2 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-white/5 hover:border-snow-400/30 transition group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-usdc/15 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-usdc/25 transition">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2775ca" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M3 12h6M3 6h6M3 18h6" />
            <path d="M9 4v16M15 4c3 0 5 3.5 5 8s-2 8-5 8" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">USDC Day One</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Avalanche Interchain Messaging bridges USDC from the C-Chain from day one — stable
          liquidity without exposure to volatile assets.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Stat strip -->
    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-center">
      <div class="bg-surface-0/50 rounded-xl py-6 border border-white/5">
        <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-snow-400">&lt;2s</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Finality</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-0/50 rounded-xl py-6 border border-white/5">
        <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-snow-400">EVM</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Compatible</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-0/50 rounded-xl py-6 border border-white/5">
        <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-snow-400">88</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Drivechain ID</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-0/50 rounded-xl py-6 border border-white/5">
        <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-snow-400">0</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide">New Tokens</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
